06:59 — R3 DONE, and it caught a real defect: StandaloneShellBoot resolved the Golf
       Profile offer itself, jumping over the account-flag wait in Navigate, so a fresh shell
       install of a server-stamped account STILL showed the capture. Fixed: the boot names GpsHub
       and Navigate decides. Case A (server-stamped, local cleared) -> flag resolved in 0.20s,
       local re-cached, lands on GpsHub. Case B (column cleared) -> capture offered once; Skip
       advanced and set the local flag. The Skip PUT returns 200 but does NOT stamp: the DEPLOYED
       Fly API has no golf_profile_prompted field (openapi confirms). Fly deploy is the remaining
       outward step. Account column restored to its original timestamp.
